# generated artifacts
# `data/` is regenerated by scripts/build_dataset.py and published on the Hub, so it
# is not versioned. `results/` and the generated tables/figures ARE versioned: a
# clean checkout can rebuild the PDF without re-running the experiment grid, and
# re-running paper/analysis.py must leave them unchanged (git diff is the check).
data/
paper/main.aux
paper/main.log
paper/main.out
paper/main.bbl
paper/main.blg
paper/main.toc
paper/main.synctex.gz
paper/*.synctex.gz
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.spl
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk

